10
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
Transcendence is a 2014 American science fiction thriller film directed by Wally
Pfister (in his directorial debut) and written by Jack Paglen.

11
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
The film stars Johnny Depp, Morgan Freeman, Rebecca Hall, Paul Bettany, Kate Mara, Cillian Murphy and Cole Hauser, and follows a group of
scientists who race to finish an artificial intelligence project while being targeted by a radical anti-technology organization.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
Paglen's screenplay was listed on the 2012 edition of The Black List, a
list of popular unproduced screenplays in Hollywood.

13
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
Transcendence was a box office flop, grossing just $103 million
against a budget of as much as $150 million.

14
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:06,000
The film received mainly mixed reviews; it was criticized for its plot structure,
characters and dialogue but praised for its cinematography, acting, and score.

15
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:06,000
The film explores themes of mind control, artificial intelligence
(a.i.), computer virus, technology, nanotechnology.

16
01:52:00,000 --> 01:52:06,000
The tone is mind_bending and emotional and thought_provoking.
